{"articleNo":"3030","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3030&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 2학기 한국장학재단 우수드림장학금 신청안내(3차)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.28","hit":"10475","attachments":[{"name":"우수드림장학금 기준(3차).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3030&attachNo=1581"},{"name":"우수드림장학금 신청메뉴얼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3030&attachNo=2532"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">2011학년도 2학기 한국장학재단 우수드림장학금 신청안내(3차)</span></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 신청기간 : 2011. 11. 29(화) ~ 12. 5(월)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(재단에서 정한&nbsp;일정이므로 기한 엄수)<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 신청자격</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생의 가구소득 5분위 이하인 자(기초생활수급자포함-본인명의)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[5분위 이하 : 환산연소득 2인가구 기준 3,944만원 수준 이하 해당자]</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 직전학기 12학점이상 이수, 평점평균 3.6이상<br><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 장학금액 : 등록금전액 (타장학금 등록금범위내 중복수혜가능)</span><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 신청방법 : 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">)을 통해<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청 후 서류제출자는 학생처(본관 101호)로 제출<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br>5. 제출서류 : 자세한 사항은&nbsp;신청메뉴얼 참고바람.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(기초생활수급권자, 장애인(본인)일 경우만&nbsp;학생처로 서류 제출)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <br>6. 장학금 지급 : 12월 중<br><br>7. 문의 : 한국장학재단 1666-5114 / 학생처 478-7065</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 우수드림장학금 신청메뉴얼 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 우수드림장학금&nbsp;기준 1부.&nbsp; 끝.<br><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양중고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2011. 11. 28.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한양견고딕,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
